1
00:00:00,299 --> 00:00:01,799
(Howard:)Hi. Howard Wolowitz.

2
00:00:01,801 --> 00:00:03,271
Oh. Issabella Concepcion.

3
00:00:03,269 --> 00:00:05,269
(Howard:)Oh, yeah, the astronomer.

4
00:00:05,271 --> 00:00:06,901
(Howard:)Raj told us
about you.

5
00:00:06,906 --> 00:00:10,406
Hey! Free toilet paper!

6
00:00:12,411 --> 00:00:15,481
(Isabella:)You told him
I was an astronomer?

7
00:00:15,481 --> 00:00:16,581
(Cleaner:)Uh...

8
00:00:16,582 --> 00:00:17,712
(Sheldon:)I understand.

9
00:00:17,717 --> 00:00:19,317
(Raj:)Time to go.
No, p-please don't.

10
00:00:19,318 --> 00:00:21,288
(Isabella:)It's okay, Rajesh,
I'm a grown woman.

11
00:00:21,287 --> 00:00:22,587
(Isabella:)I don't have to waste my time

12
00:00:22,588 --> 00:00:24,418
(Sheldon:)with someone
who's embarrassed by me.

13
00:00:28,494 --> 00:00:30,324
(Howard:)I can keep this, right?

14
00:00:30,329 --> 00:00:32,559
Issabella!

15
00:00:32,565 --> 00:00:34,065
Issabella, wait,
wait, let me explain.

16
00:00:34,066 --> 00:00:36,566
(Isabella:)If you are embarrassed
by what I do,

17
00:00:36,569 --> 00:00:38,839
(Isabella:)why did you pursue me?
I'm sorry.

18
00:00:38,838 --> 00:00:41,708
Honestly, I-I didn't think
your job would bother me,

19
00:00:41,707 --> 00:00:43,037
(Raj:)but I guess it did.

20
00:00:43,042 --> 00:00:44,742
(Raj:)And I hate myself for that.

21
00:00:44,744 --> 00:00:46,214
(Raj:)But there's
a lot of things

22
00:00:46,212 --> 00:00:48,282
(Raj:)about me that would
totally embarrass you.

23
00:00:48,281 --> 00:00:49,581
(Isabella:)I doubt that.

24
00:00:49,582 --> 00:00:51,482
(Raj:)Well, prepare to be mortified.

25
00:00:52,418 --> 00:00:54,648
(Raj:)I let my dog eat food out
of my mouth,

26
00:00:54,654 --> 00:00:57,324
(Raj:)not because she likes it
but because I do.

27
00:00:57,323 --> 00:01:01,493
(Raj:)Also, I know they're pretty,
but I'm scared of butterflies.

